======================================================================
CASE 1:  alpha = 0,  gamma = delta*(1 - beta)/(2 - beta)
======================================================================
  f_1(beta, delta) = delta*(beta - 1)/(beta - 2)
  max over beta in [0,1]: f_1 = delta/2
  At delta = 9/8: f_1 = 9/16
======================================================================
CASE 2:  gamma = eta*alpha + (1 - eta)*delta  (constraint tight)
======================================================================
  f_2(alpha, eta, delta) = (-alpha*(delta - 1) + (alpha*eta - delta*(eta - 1))*(-alpha*eta + delta*(eta - 1) + delta))/(-alpha*eta + delta*(eta - 1) + delta)
  d/dalpha f_2 = (alpha**2*eta**2 - 2*alpha*delta*eta**2 + delta**2*eta**2 - delta**2 + delta)/(eta*(alpha**2 - 2*alpha*delta + delta**2))
  stationary points alpha*: [-sqrt(delta)*sqrt(delta - 1)/eta + delta, sqrt(delta)*sqrt(delta - 1)/eta + delta]
    candidate alpha*(eta, 9/8) = 3*(3*eta - 1)/(8*eta);  FPS = (9 - 3/eta)/8 = 3*(3*eta - 1)/(8*eta)
    candidate alpha*(eta, 9/8) = 3*(3*eta + 1)/(8*eta);  FPS = (9 - 3/eta)/8 = 3*(3*eta - 1)/(8*eta)
  alpha*(eta, delta) = -sqrt(delta)*sqrt(delta - 1)/eta + delta
  alpha*(eta, 9/8)   = 3*(3*eta - 1)/(8*eta)
  At eta = 5/7, delta = 9/8: alpha* = 3/5  (FPS: 3/4)
======================================================================
CASE 2a:  alpha = alpha*(eta, delta),  eta >= eta_boundary
======================================================================
  f_2a(eta, delta) = -2*delta**(3/2)/sqrt(delta - 1) + 2*sqrt(delta)/sqrt(delta - 1) + delta + delta/eta - 1/eta
  At delta = 9/8: f_2a(eta) = (3*eta + 1)/(8*eta)
  FPS form was (3 + 1/eta)/8.  Check at eta = 5/7:
    FPS:  (3 + 7/5)/8 = 11/20 = 11/20
    Ours: f_2a(5/7, 9/8) = 11/20
  d/d eta f_2a = (1 - delta)/eta**2
  At delta = 9/8: d/d eta f_2a = -1/(8*eta**2)

  Case 2a/2b boundary: alpha*(eta, delta) = 2 - 1/eta
  Solutions for eta_boundary(delta): [(sqrt(delta)*sqrt(delta - 1) - 1)/(delta - 2)]
    eta_boundary(9/8) candidate = 5/7   (FPS gives 5/7)
  eta_boundary(delta) = (sqrt(delta)*sqrt(delta - 1) - 1)/(delta - 2)
  f_2a at the boundary eta = eta_b(delta):
    f_2a(eta_b, delta) = (-delta**(5/2) - delta**(3/2) + 2*sqrt(delta) + delta**2*sqrt(delta - 1) + 2*delta*sqrt(delta - 1) - 2*sqrt(delta - 1))/(-delta**(3/2) + sqrt(delta) + sqrt(delta - 1))
    At delta = 9/8: 11/20  (FPS: 11/20)
  max over Case 2a interval: f_2a = (-delta**(5/2) - delta**(3/2) + 2*sqrt(delta) + delta**2*sqrt(delta - 1) + 2*delta*sqrt(delta - 1) - 2*sqrt(delta - 1))/(-delta**(3/2) + sqrt(delta) + sqrt(delta - 1))  (since f_2a is decreasing in eta)
======================================================================
CASE 2b:  alpha = beta = 2 - 1/eta,  eta in [1/2, eta_boundary)
======================================================================
  f_2b(eta, delta) = (-eta*(delta*(eta - 1) - 2*eta + 1)*(delta*(eta - 1) + delta - 2*eta + 1) - (delta - 1)*(2*eta - 1))/(eta*(delta*(eta - 1) + delta - 2*eta + 1))
  At delta = 9/8: (49*eta**3 - 49*eta**2 + 8*eta - 8)/(8*eta*(7*eta - 8))
  At delta = 9/8, eta = 1/2: 9/16  (FPS: 9/16)
  d/d eta f_2b = (-delta**3*eta**4 + 6*delta**2*eta**4 - 2*delta**2*eta**3 + 2*delta**2*eta**2 - 2*delta**2*eta - 12*delta*eta**4 + 8*delta*eta**3 - 7*delta*eta**2 + 6*delta*eta - delta + 8*eta**4 - 8*eta**3 + 6*eta**2 - 4*eta + 1)/(eta**2*(delta**2*eta**2 - 4*delta*eta**2 + 2*delta*eta + 4*eta**2 - 4*eta + 1))
  At delta = 9/8: d/d eta f_2b = (343*eta**4 - 784*eta**3 + 336*eta**2 + 112*eta - 64)/(8*eta**2*(49*eta**2 - 112*eta + 64))
  f_2b(eta = 1/2, delta) = delta/2
  max over Case 2b interval: f_2b = delta/2  (assuming decreasing in eta)
======================================================================
OVERALL F(delta) = max(f_1, f_2a, f_2b) and the optimal delta
======================================================================
  f_1 (delta)     = delta/2
  f_2a(delta)     = (-delta**(5/2) - delta**(3/2) + 2*sqrt(delta) + delta**2*sqrt(delta - 1) + 2*delta*sqrt(delta - 1) - 2*sqrt(delta - 1))/(-delta**(3/2) + sqrt(delta) + sqrt(delta - 1))
  f_2b(delta)     = delta/2

  Sanity check at delta = 9/8:
    f_1(9/8) = 9/16
    f_2a(9/8) = 11/20
    f_2b(9/8) = 9/16

  Equalising f_1(delta) = f_2a(delta):
    delta = [4/3, -1 + 4/(3*(1/2 + sqrt(687)*I/18)**(1/3)) + (1/2 + sqrt(687)*I/18)**(1/3)]
  Equalising f_2b(delta) = f_2a(delta):
    delta = [4/3, -1 + 4/(3*(1/2 + sqrt(687)*I/18)**(1/3)) + (1/2 + sqrt(687)*I/18)**(1/3)]

