    lim f_2b(delta) = 1/2

  d/d delta f_2a = (-delta**(7/2)*sqrt(delta - 1) - delta**(3/2)*sqrt(delta - 1) + 2*sqrt(delta)*sqrt(delta - 1) + delta**4 - delta**3/2 + delta**2 - 7*delta/2 + 2)/(-delta**(7/2)*sqrt(delta - 1) + 2*delta**(5/2)*sqrt(delta - 1) - 2*delta**(3/2)*sqrt(delta - 1) + sqrt(delta)*sqrt(delta - 1) + 2*delta**3 - 4*delta**2 + 2*delta)
  Sign of d/d delta f_2a at delta = 9/8: -0.666667  (positive => f_2a increasing in delta)

