  Symbolic attempt: rationalise the equation delta/2 = f_2a(delta) and solve.
    Equation: 2*f_2a - delta = (-2*delta**(13/2)*sqrt(delta - 1) - 4*delta**(11/2)*sqrt(delta - 1) + 10*delta**(9/2)*sqrt(delta - 1) + 10*delta**(7/2)*sqrt(delta - 1) - 16*delta**(5/2)*sqrt(delta - 1) + 10*delta**(3/2)*sqrt(delta - 1) - 8*sqrt(delta)*sqrt(delta - 1) + delta**7 + 2*delta**6 - 8*delta**5 - 4*delta**4 + 18*delta**3 - 16*delta**2 + 11*delta - 4)/(delta**6 - 4*delta**4 + 2*delta**3 + 1)

  All real roots of f_1(delta) = f_2a(delta) in [1, 2]:
    delta = 1.1149075415  (f_1 = f_2a = 0.5574537707)
    delta = 1.3333333333  (f_1 = f_2a = 0.6666666667)
    delta = 1.6180339887  (f_1 = f_2a = 0.8090169944)

  KEY: the minimum of F(delta) = max(delta/2, f_2a(delta)) is at the
